align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">30.0</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Amlodipine&#x02013;olmesartan (10/40 mg)</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">56.3</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">21.2</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">38.2</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">52.0</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">12.5</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">55.5</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">53.3</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">46.0</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tfn2-ibpc-3-155"><p><bold>Abbreviations:</bold> DM, diabetes mellitus; BMI, body mass index; BP, blood pressure.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-group></article>